    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vuka, ukhanye; ngoba ukukhanya kwakho kufikile, lenkazimulo yeNKOSI iphuma phezu kwakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba bheka, ubumnyama buyakusibekela umhlaba, nobumnyama abantu; kepha uJehova uyakuphakama phezu kwakho, inkazimulo yakhe ibonakale phezu kwakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abezizwe bayakuza ekukhanyeni kwakho, namakhosi ekukhazimuleni kokuvuka kwakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phakamisa amehlo akho nxazonke, ubone: bonke bayabuthana, beza kuwe; amadodana akho ayakuvela kude, namadodakazi akho ayosuwa ngaseceleni kwakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khona uyakubona, ugobhoze kanyekanye, inhliziyo yakho yesabe, yande; ngoba ukuchichima kolwandle kuyakuphendukela kuwe, amandla abezizwe ayakuza kuwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubuningi bamakamela buyakukusibekela, amakamela akwaMidiyani nase-Efa; lonke iSheba liyofika; igolide nempepho bayoletha; futhi bayoshumayela izindumiso zikaJehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonke imihlambi yaseKedari iyakubuthelwa kuwe, izinqama zaseNebayoti zikukhonze; bayokwenyukela e-altare lami ngokujabula, futhi ngizokhazimulisa indlu yenkazimulo yami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngubani ondiza njengefu nanjengamajuba esiya emafasiteleni awo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Impela iziqhingi ziyakungilindela mina kuqala, nemikhumbi yaseTharishishi ukuletha amadodana akho evela kude, isiliva lawo negolide lawo kanye nawo, egameni likaJehova uNkulunkulu wakho, nakoNgcwele ka-Israyeli, likukhazimulisile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantwana bezinye izizwe bayakuzakha izingange zakho, amakhosi abo akukhonze; ngoba ekuthukutheleni kwami ngakutshaya, kodwa ngokuthanda kwami ngakuhawukela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yingakho amasango akho eyohlala evuliwe; imini nobusuku zingavalwa; ukuze abantu balethe kuwe amabutho ezizwe, futhi amakhosi azo alethwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba isizwe nombuso ongakukhonze kuyakubhubha; yebo, lezo zizwe ziyobhujiswa ngokuphelele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkazimulo yaseLebanoni iyakuza kuwe, umsayipuresi, nomsayipuresi, nomphongolo kanyekanye, kuhlobise indawo yendlu yami engcwele; ngiyakwenza indawo yezinyawo zami ibe yinkazimulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadodana abakucindezelayo ayakuza kuwe ekukhothamela; bonke abakudelelayo bayakukhothama phambi kwamathe ezinyawo zakho; bayakukubiza ngokuthi uMuzi kaJehova, iSiyoni loNgcwele ka-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngesikhathi ulahliwe futhi uzondwa, kungaze kudlule muntu kuwe, ngizokwenza inkazimulo yaphakade, intokozo ezizukulwaneni ngezizukulwane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyakuncela ubisi lwezizwe, uncele amabele amakhosi, wazi ukuthi mina Jehova nginguMhlengi wakho noMhlengi wakho, uMninimandla kaJakobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esikhundleni sethusi ngiyakuletha igolide, esikhundleni sensimbi ngilethe isiliva, esikhundleni sokhuni ithusi, esikhundleni samatshe ngilethe insimbi; ngiyakwenza ukuthula ezincekwini zakho nokwahlulela izinceku zakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.60.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.60.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 60:17"
          },
