        {
          "text": "Ubudlova abuyikuzwakala ezweni lakho, ukuchithwa nokuchithwa emikhawulweni yakho; kodwa uyakubiza izindonga zakho ngokuthi iNsindiso namasango akho ngokuthi iNdumiso.",
