        {
          "text": "Ilanga alisayikuba ngukukhanya kwakho emini; nenyanga ayiyikukukhanyisela, kepha uJehova uyakuba ngukukhanya okuphakade kuwe, uNkulunkulu wakho abe yinkazimulo yakho.",
